      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c36b2b22df2804a64fcaca4|full_name}: Not everyone has a high end PC so blocking most of the bad performing avatars may be a good way to get back to a stable framerate and encourage/motivate people to optimize avatars for a better performance. I just came back from a session where I had to block 50-60% of the avatars to stay above 45fps. So I was in really bad mood when I wrote the first part. I felt the urge to edit it later but didn't want to reduct my burst of anger....",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
