      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: eh, you're fine. I wouldn't remove it, I personally think it helps get your feelings on the situation across. Powerful feelings can get powerful responses. It's good that you took the time to explain your situation to me but if any editing is to be done it should be adding what you've told me here to the bottom of the post. I may not be someone who cares about optimization of my avatars but I really do understand people can't really handle the lag. \n\nTo that I say, good luck on this getting added people really seem to need it",
