      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"makes no sense at all with all the bad public avatars\" rank system was not made for performance, but to prevent (or rether discourage) quick account creation and use of malicious annoying avatars in publics with them. And those avatars can easily be made to have ideal performance rating.",
