      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "-1.\nIt is hard to really measure that performance, even server side, as currently model can change depending on gestures, animations etc. \nSo some avatar might have a lot of performance-heavy stuff, but never enabled at once or only when some animation is active.\n\nAlso current rating system is just tragic, like cloth performance can be pretty good, but rating system does not care about all settings on your avatar, like it does just measure amount of bones but not update rate - same with cloth, I can have avatar with 400 cloth vertices that will be lagging like hell, or 3000 that will perform much better.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
