  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-28T17:25:08.589Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If they are lower than medium block them or even better delete them. The sdk does nothing to prevent people from uploding crap. As soon as I block all red marked avatars the game runs fine even in full worlds. If that sounds too brutal for you then get rid of the rank system and make it make it performance based. So instead of blocking new players(makes no sense at all with all the bad public avatars) I want a performance based system so I can block all avatars below the medium level.",
